### 6. ᾱ_t ("alpha bar") is…
*Diffusion*

- **(a)** the learning rate at step t
- **(b)** the sum of all betas up to step t
- **(c)** the cumulative product of α_1 … α_t, which tells how much of the original image survives after t steps
- **(d)** the U-Net's prediction at step t

