### 14. Rearrange pooling turns (B, C, H, W) into…
*Optimizations*

- **(a)** (B, C, H/2, W/2) by keeping the largest value of each 2×2 patch
- **(b)** (B, C/4, 2H, 2W)
- **(c)** (B, 4C, H/2, W/2) by moving each 2×2 patch into the channel axis, so no pixel is discarded
- **(d)** (B, C, H, W) unchanged

